{'symbol': 'WDC', 'date': '2023-03-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'DNA DATA STORAGE ALLIANCE ANNOUNCES BOARD APPOINTMENTS', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE DNA DATA STORAGE ALLIANCE, A SNIA TECHNOLOGY AFFILIATE, FORMED IN 2020 BY ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN), MICROSOFT (NASDAQ: MSFT), TWIST BIOSCIENCE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TWST) AND WESTERN DIGITAL (NASDAQ: WDC) TO CREATE AND PROMOTE AN INTEROPERABLE STORAGE ECOSYSTEM BASED ON DNA AS A DATA STORAGE MEDIUM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENTS OF CATALOG TECHNOLOGIES AND QUANTUM CORPORATION TO THE GOVERNING BOARD OF THE ALLIANCE.'}